        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那么这个“十”字啊，其中呢，就占有很大的比重。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.649,
      "end": 9.655,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "自古以来，精添细粮、勤俭节约，",
      "score": 0.2837,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5828,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5945,
        "sc_delta": -0.0117,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.399,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "自古以来，精天细量，勤俭节约。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 9.655,
      "end": 11.903,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就是我们中华民族的一个传统美德。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.001,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0011,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就是我们中华民族的一个传统美德。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 12.042,
      "end": 18.06,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "但随着现在生活逐渐的好起来了，好多地方呢都出现了有些浪费食的东西这种现象。",
      "score": 0.0653,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0309,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0316,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但说到现在，生活逐渐的好些了，好多地方呢都出现了有些浪费吃的东西这种现象。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 18.06,
      "end": 21.02,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那我们点哪子来杜绝浪费食物呢？",
      "score": 0.2582,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.459,
        "sc_logprob": -0.4055,
        "sc_delta": 0.0535,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.308,
        "seg_cer": 0.214,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我们该啷子来杜绝浪费食物呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 21.02,
      "end": 30.692,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我们几个看着。从要求浪费之风无比狠刹，",
      "score": 0.5047,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9415,
        "sc_logprob": -0.9811,
        "sc_delta": -0.0396,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.663,
        "seg_cer": 0.471,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "从要求浪费之风，务必狠刹。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 30.837,
      "end": 33.952,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "到要求厉行节约反对浪费，",
      "score": 0.6031,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.8271,
        "sc_logprob": -1.7966,
        "sc_delta": 0.0305,
